LanternBoy: {
	DisplayName: The Lantern Boy
	Origin: A lamp at the end of the mountain road, no one beneath it; look again, and you are the one inside the lamp
	Power: 「Guiding Light」Three Ghost Lanterns orbit the bearer, their shadows echoing Onikiri's normal slashes off-beat for a combined sixty percent of its power.
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

CrimsonBride: {
	DisplayName: The Crimson Bride
	Origin: The bridal palanquin waited at the gate for seven nights
	Power: 「The Procession」Press the Self-Restart key and the palanquin comes following your trail of blood, carrying the blade-bearer into an empty wedding hall; at the nuptial toast, wounds and afflictions alike are restarted.
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

ScapeGhost: {
	DisplayName: The Scapegoat Wraith
	Origin: It had no name in life, only the memory of dying in another's place again and again. When the register turns, its birth date is written beside yours
	Power: 「Death's Stand-In」At the instant death arrives, it seizes a life from afar and forces your death into that body
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

HeadlessShade: {
	DisplayName: The Headless Shade
	Origin: The shadow at your feet twitches; on nights when the lamplight sways, there is nothing above its shoulders
	Power: 「Dismember」It lurks behind you, then rushes anything living and tears its body into pieces
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

GhostHand: {
	DisplayName: The Charred Hand
	Origin: A charred, withered, horrifying arm
	Power: 「Grip」Seized targets are suppressed and their movement is restricted
	DeathReason: "{0} was dragged into the wall"
}

GhostRain: {
	DisplayName: The Ghost Rain
	Origin: That is not a sky — it is faces, pressing down layer upon layer
	Power: 「Ghost Rain」While equipped and Onikiri is held, the gloom stays and the ghost rain pours; living things caught in the veil are slowly eaten away, or dragged up into the rain
	DeathReason: "{0} was claimed by the rain"
}

System: {
	ScapeGhostActivated: 「Death's Stand-In」— {0} bore this death in your place
	ScapeGhostUnknownTarget: something living
	ScapeGhostDeathBroadcast: "{0} took the hit for {1} — {2}"
	ErosionCrawl: Something is crawling beneath the skin
	ErosionStain: A corpse-blue tinge creeps up the fingertips
	ErosionMirror: The thing in the mirror does not quite look like you
	RevivalKillReason: "{0} was wholly claimed by the returning wraith"
	BrideRiteText: 「The Procession」
	GhostRainRiteText: 「Summon Rain」
}
